@startuml
actor User
boundary "views/memos/index.html.erb" as View
control "MemosController" as Controller
entity "Memo Model" as Model
database "Database" as DB

User -> View: Request list of memos
View -> Controller: Send GET /memos request
Controller -> Model: Query all memos
Model -> DB: Fetch list of memos
DB --> Model: Return list of memos
Model --> Controller: Return list of memos
Controller -> View: Render list of memos
View -> User: Display list of memos
@enduml
